      "version": "1.0.0",
      "createdAt": 1777805813106,
      "changelog": "Initial release of n8n-evol-I: a read-only skill package to author, deploy, and operate n8n workflows from code.\n\n- Routes user requests to a library of lifecycle sub-skills (init, bootstrap-env, deploy, run, resync, and more).\n- Supports a rich set of helpers for composing, validating, deploying, and maintaining n8n workflows programmatically.\n- Provides reference docs for best practices, workflow patterns, and common n8n integrations.\n- Uses a modular design: sub-skills handle specific authoring and operational tasks.\n- Comprehensive skill and integration documentation included for n8n assistants.",
